                "metadata": {
                    "category": "music",
                    "author": "Rodgers & Hammerstein",
                    "previewAudio": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/the-sound-of-music.mp3",
                    "description": "The hills are alive in this timeless classic! Celebrate the 60th anniversary of the most beloved musical of all time with the original soundtrack to the five-time Academy Award-winning film, featuring music by the legendary Rodgers & Hammerstein.  \n\nYou can have confidence this collection includes all the iconic songs that have captured hearts for generations, including \"My Favorite Things,\" \"Do-Re-Mi,\" \"Edelweiss,\" and the soaring title track, performed by Maria herself, the incomparable Julie Andrews. It will soon become one of your little one's favorite things.\n\n A timeless treasure, The Sound of Music promises an uplifting and nostalgic listening experience for the entire family.",
